          Use our <a href="/" class="text-link hover:underline">free settlement calculator</a> to estimate your claim's fair value before responding to any offer. And check our guide on <a href="/blog/how-car-accident-settlements-are-calculated/" class="text-link hover:underline">how car accident settlements are calculated</a> to understand exactly how that number is determined.
        </p>

